.TH ifg-milestone 1  "ifg-milestone 0.8.0" 
.SH NAME
ifg\-milestone \- Work with repository milestones
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg milestone\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with repository milestones
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-milestone\-list(1)
List milestones
.TP
ifg\-milestone\-create(1)
Create a milestone
.TP
ifg\-milestone\-edit(1)
Edit a milestone identified by its current title
.TP
ifg\-milestone\-delete(1)
Delete a milestone (asks for confirmation unless \-\-yes)
.TP
ifg\-milestone\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0
